Vyohm Studio design-variety check — 2026-11-15
Builder: next dev on :3000 (real Claude calls, model claude-opus-5-5, effort medium). Pages rendered with the export renderer (components/site) at 1440 px and 390 px in headless Chrome.

=== Round 1: five briefs in parallel (loom-a and loom-b use the same brief) ===
loom-a   33.4s direction 4: Atelier Ledger | editorial and sharp: oversized left-aligned serif type, hairline outline details, zero radius, one solid gold manifesto band | background #0b0b0a, accent #c9a84c | serif | asymmetric-big-type
loom-b   35.7s direction 4: Tailor's Ledger | sharp editorial broadsheet; oversized light-weight serif type, zero radius, hairline outline cards and one solid gold band to close | background #0b0b0a, accent #c9a54c | serif | asymmetric-big-type
bakery   44.6s direction 4: Kitchen Table | relaxed family kitchen, fresh sage and forest green with honey highlights, playful 24px corners | background #eef3ea, accent #2f5d3a with honey #f2b84b | rounded | centered-image-below
fintech  32.2s direction 3: Swiss Grid | precise, no-nonsense trust through strict left alignment, heavy sans type, sharp corners and one cobalt accent | background #ffffff, accent #1d4ed8 | sans | asymmetric-big-type
gym      40.4s direction 4: Raw Iron | stripped-back industrial grit, giant monospaced type, sharp edges, outline cards and one red band | background #0b0b0b, accent #d40000 | mono | asymmetric-big-type

Briefs:
  loom-a, loom-b: Loom & Line, premium clothing, black-and-gold, three collections, contact button (the challenge example)
  bakery:  Crumb & Co, family-run sourdough bakery, warm and friendly, breads/pastries/workshops, order button
  fintech: Ledgerly, bookkeeping app for freelancers, clean and trustworthy (no colours given)
  gym:     IronPeak, strength gym for beginners, bold, red and black, three plans, free-trial button

