Columns: hero = hero container and where its image is; bgStyle = s solid / g gradient / p spotlight per section;
labels = badge/eyebrow paragraphs; arrows = arrow buttons / all buttons; centred = centred headings / all headings.

Finding: fonts, colours, radius and section patterns now follow each brief, but the random number was 4 in four of
five runs and direction 4 was 'big asymmetric type' each time, so loom-a and loom-b looked alike.
Changes after round 1: the server never picks the same number twice in a row; the prompt requires the four
directions to use four different hero layouts.

